Three `getFirstLinkpathDest` calls remain at lines 627, 641 and 681, all inside `findImportedAssetFile` and `processLink`'s general resolution. Those resolve *links the note already contained* against pre-existing vault files, not files written this run, so the cold-cache problem doesn't apply. I left them.

